{"route":"/docs/5.1/getting-started/parcel/","version":"5.1","renderedVersion":"5.1","title":{"id":"content","type":"heading","en":"Parcel","level":1},"lead":{"id":"content--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Learn how to include Bootstrap in your project using Parcel."},"blocks":[{"id":"install-parcel","type":"heading","en":"Install Parcel","level":2},{"id":"install-parcel--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Install <a href=\"https://en.parceljs.org/getting_started.html\">Parcel Bundler</a>."},{"id":"install-bootstrap","type":"heading","en":"Install Bootstrap","level":2},{"id":"install-bootstrap--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"<a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.1/getting-started/download/#npm\">Install bootstrap</a> as a Node.js module using npm."},{"id":"install-bootstrap--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"Bootstrap depends on <a href=\"https://github.com/floating-ui/popper-docs/blob/main/docs/v2/index.md\">Popper</a>, which is specified in the <code>peerDependencies</code> property. This means that you will have to make sure to add both of them to your <code>package.json</code> using <code>npm install @popperjs/core</code>."},{"id":"install-bootstrap--paragraph-3","type":"paragraph","en":"When all will be completed, your project will be structured like this:"},{"id":"install-bootstrap--code-1","type":"code","value":"project-name/\n├── build/\n├── node_modules/\n│   └── bootstrap/\n│   └── popper.js/\n├── scss/\n│   └── custom.scss\n├── src/\n│   └── index.html\n│   └── index.js\n└── package.json","language":"text"},{"id":"importing-javascript","type":"heading","en":"Importing JavaScript","level":2},{"id":"importing-javascript--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Import <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.1/getting-started/javascript/\">Bootstrap’s JavaScript</a> in your app’s entry point (usually <code>src/index.js</code>). You can import all our plugins in one file or separately if you require only a subset of them."},{"id":"importing-javascript--code-1","type":"code","value":"// Import all plugins\nimport * as bootstrap from 'bootstrap';\n\n// Or import only needed plugins\nimport { Tooltip as Tooltip, Toast as Toast, Popover as Popover } from 'bootstrap';\n\n// Or import just one\nimport Alert as Alert from '../node_modules/bootstrap/js/dist/alert';","language":"js"},{"id":"importing-css","type":"heading","en":"Importing CSS","level":2},{"id":"importing-css--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"To utilize the full potential of Bootstrap and customize it to your needs, use the source files as a part of your project’s bundling process."},{"id":"importing-css--paragraph-2","type":"paragraph","en":"Create your own <code>scss/custom.scss</code> to <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.1/customize/sass/#importing\">import Bootstrap’s Sass files</a> and then override the <a href=\"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.1/customize/sass/#variable-defaults\">built-in custom variables</a>."},{"id":"build-app","type":"heading","en":"Build app","level":2},{"id":"build-app--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Include <code>src/index.js</code> before the closing <code>&lt;/body&gt;</code> tag."},{"id":"build-app--code-1","type":"code","value":"<!doctype html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n  <head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\">\n  </head>\n  <body>\n    <script src=\"./index.js\"></script>\n  </body>\n</html>","language":"html"},{"id":"edit-packagejson","type":"heading","en":"Edit <code>package.json</code>","level":3},{"id":"edit-packagejson--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Add <code>dev</code> and <code>build</code> scripts in your <code>package.json</code> file."},{"id":"edit-packagejson--code-1","type":"code","value":"\"scripts\": {\n  \"dev\": \"parcel ./src/index.html\",\n  \"prebuild\": \"npx rimraf build\",\n  \"build\": \"parcel build --public-url ./ ./src/index.html --experimental-scope-hoisting --out-dir build\"\n}","language":"json"},{"id":"run-dev-script","type":"heading","en":"Run dev script","level":3},{"id":"run-dev-script--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Your app will be accessible at <code>http://127.0.0.1:1234</code>."},{"id":"run-dev-script--code-1","type":"code","value":"npm run dev","language":"sh"},{"id":"build-app-files","type":"heading","en":"Build app files","level":3},{"id":"build-app-files--paragraph-1","type":"paragraph","en":"Built files are in the <code>build/</code> folder."},{"id":"build-app-files--code-1","type":"code","value":"npm run build","language":"sh"}],"demos":[],"nav":[{"en":"Introduction","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.1/getting-started/introduction/"},{"en":"Download","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.1/getting-started/download/"},{"en":"Contents","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.1/getting-started/contents/"},{"en":"Browsers & devices","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.1/getting-started/browsers-devices/"},{"en":"JavaScript","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.1/getting-started/javascript/"},{"en":"Webpack","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.1/getting-started/webpack/"},{"en":"Parcel","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.1/getting-started/parcel/"},{"en":"Accessibility","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.1/getting-started/accessibility/"},{"en":"RFS","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.1/getting-started/rfs/"},{"en":"RTL","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.1/getting-started/rtl/"},{"en":"Contribute","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.1/getting-started/contribute/"},{"en":"Overview","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.1/customize/overview/"},{"en":"Sass","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.1/customize/sass/"},{"en":"Options","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.1/customize/options/"},{"en":"Color","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.1/customize/color/"},{"en":"Components","href":"https://getbootstrap.com/docs/5.1/customize/components/"},{"en":"CSS variables","href":"http